<section class="section program-section" id="program">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading heading-split"><div><p class="eyebrow">The education program</p><h2>Make room for a learner’s <em>next chapter.</em></h2></div><p class="section-lede">Change the World Foundation–Uganda (CWF–Uganda) is a youth-driven, community-based organization in Gulu City. Education support is part of our work with vulnerable children and young people to build resilient, self-reliant communities.</p></div>
    <div class="program-grid">
      <article class="program-card card-featured"><div class="card-number">01 <span>· CORE SUPPORT</span></div><div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">✎</div><h3>School assistance</h3><p>Help learners access the practical support they need to participate in education. We advocate for quality education and provide school assistance for vulnerable children and youth.</p><a class="card-link" href="#support">Discuss learner support <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
      <article class="program-card"><div class="card-number">02 <span>· GUIDANCE</span></div><div class="card-icon icon-lilac" aria-hidden="true">↗</div><h3>Mentorship</h3><p>Encouragement and guidance can help young people stay engaged, find direction and build confidence as they work toward their goals.</p><a class="card-link" href="#support">Support mentorship <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
      <article class="program-card"><div class="card-number">03 <span>· LEARNING</span></div><div class="card-icon icon-green" aria-hidden="true">Aa</div><h3>Literacy &amp; skills</h3><p>Literacy and skills development strengthen learning foundations and help young people prepare for further education and opportunity.</p><a class="card-link" href="#support">Help build skills <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    </div>
    <p class="program-footnote"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> Our wider work also includes community health promotion and economic empowerment for youth and women.</p>
  </div>
</section>
